      <section>
      <div>
        <div class="magazine__items">
                      <div class="magazine__single-item"><div class="aalto-magazine ">
      <div class="magazine__text-wrap magazine__text-wrap--carousel">
      <div class="magazine__text-container">
          <h2 class="magazine__header">We aim to change the world for the better</h2>
          <p class="magazine__summary">We Are The School of Science. Through our internationally-acclaimed high-level research we aim to make a significant impact on society. The research at our school focuses on advanced energy solutions, condensed matter and materials physics; creation and transformation of technology based business; data science and artificial intelligence; health technology; neuroscience; and software engineering.</p>
                      <ul class="aalto-list-unstyled">
                                                <li class="magazine__link-item">
                    <a  class="highlight magazine__link" href="/en/school-of-science/school-of-science-departments">
                      Departments                    </a>
                  </li>
                                                                <li class="magazine__link-item">
                    <a  class="highlight magazine__link" href="/en/study-at-aalto#/">
                      Apply to Aalto                    </a>
                  </li>
                                          </ul>
                </div>
    </div>
    <div class="aalto-magazine-image-container">
    
                    


  
      
